$MDESC::Type = "TAC";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> TAC Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Ymir" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Fog" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> are fighting for control of inhospitable crags of the ice world of Ymir.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their flag to capture it for 5 Team Points. There is also a switch that controls the weapons that defend the NoFlyZone. This switch not only gives your Team 5 points it allows point to point flag capping. If you do not control the NoFlyZone then you will have to take the long way around. The first team to reach 30 points shall be the victor!" @
         "\n\n<f1>For the TAC Mod:<f0> www.tribes-universe.com/tac/" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map designed by:<f0> [TPG]SaNTa[DTM]";
	 
